### Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics data collection in production:

1. Deploy the application to Vercel: `vercel deploy`
2. Navigate to the Vercel dashboard → Your Project → Analytics
3. Click "Enable" to activate analytics tracking
4. Analytics routes will be available at `/_vercel/insights/*` after deployment

### Technical Notes

- The implementation is framework-specific for Next.js App Router
- Uses the `@vercel/analytics/next` import path (not the React-specific one)
- Component is properly placed before closing `</body>` tag as recommended
- No additional configuration or environment variables required
- Analytics will automatically start tracking page views once enabled in Vercel dashboard

